  "code" : "public int[] asteroidCollision(int[] asteroids) {\n    Deque<Integer> stack = new ArrayDeque<>();\n    for (int a : asteroids) {\n        boolean alive = true;\n        while (alive && a < 0 && !stack.isEmpty() && stack.peek() > 0) {\n            if (stack.peek() < -a) {\n                stack.pop();\n            } else if (stack.peek() == -a) {\n                stack.pop();\n                alive = false;\n            } else {\n                alive = false;\n            }\n        }\n        if (alive) {\n            stack.push(a);\n        }\n    }\n    return toArray(stack);\n}",
